  "ALL_TEXT": "25 EXT. GOVARDHAN'S BUILDING-GATE - DAY \nA Toyota Fortuner, with the single digit number 9 on its \nplate, stops at the building\u2019s gate. Four well built men rush \nin and enter past the gate, and almost immediately rush out \nwith a POMERANIAN spitz. They enter the Toyota Fortuner and \ndrive away. \nPOM OWNER (O.S.) \nMahalakshmi! Mahalakshmi! \nMahalakshmi ni kidnap chesaaru! \nHearing this inside the security cabin near the gate wakes an \nasleep INUMAYYA. INUMAYYA is a filthy little man with a \nshaggy beard and shabby clothes. He wears a dark blue uniform \nand a blue cap common among the security guards, only a small \nmetal alcohol flask around his neck to go with it. INUMAYYA \nhas a drink from the flask before going back to sleep. \nCUT TO:",
